    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saul of Tarsus is a Bible video game that follows the apostle Paul during his youth as a new believer. The game begins on the road to Damascus and follows Saul into the city. There he interacts with people of a variety of ideologies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game plays like a classic RPG with a unique debate system replacing standard battle sequences. Saul uses his powers of persuasion along with his growing faith to navigate the city, help several people within it, and begin his journey as the most influential church builder in the history of Christianity.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saul of Tarsus is a Bible video game that follows the apostle Paul during his youth as a new believer. The game begins on the road to Damascus and follows Saul into the city. There he interacts with people of a variety of ideologies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game plays like a classic RPG with a unique debate system replacing standard battle sequences. Saul uses his powers of persuasion along with his growing faith to navigate the city, help several people within it, and begin his journey as the most influential church builder in the history of Christianity.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Saul of Tarsus is a Bible video game in the style of a retro JRPG that follows the Apostle Paul during his youth as a new believer. Explore the ancient city of Damascus, interacting with it's citizens as you work to build a new church within the city.",
